-    2026-09-11 CORRECTION.  This docstring used to say that value was 1.022x
-    the Courant limit and therefore unstable.  That was OUR misreading, not
-    the paper's error: taking "32 cells" as 32 INTERVALS gives dx = 1.5625 mm
-    and CFL = 3.009 ps, so 3.075 ps looks 1.022x over.  Taking it as 32 grid
